      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Consume Flesh",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "manipulate"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements The ghoul is adjacent to the corpse of a creature that died within the last hour.\n\n---\n\nEffect The ghoul devours a chunk of the corpse and regains 3d6 healing Hit Points.\n\nIt can regain Hit Points from any given corpse only once."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Ghoul Fever",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "disease"
      ],
      "text": "Saving Throw DC 22 Fortitude save\n\n---\n\nStage 1 carrier with no ill effect (1 day)\n\nStage 2 2d6 void damage and regains half as many Hit Points from all healing (1 day)\n\nStage 3 as stage 2 (1 day)\n\nStage 4 2d6 void damage and gains no benefit from healing (1 day)\n\nStage 5 as stage 4 (1 day)\n\nStage 6 dead, and rises as a Ghoul the next midnight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Gnaw and Chew",
      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements Hymmir is in a hungry rage\n\n---\n\nEffect Hymmir attempts a jaws Strike. If he hits, he chews at his target and inflicts an additional 1d6 slashing damage. Hymmir regains 3d6 healing Hit Points.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "roll-option",
          "option": "gnaw-and-chew",
          "toggleable": true
        },
