        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "Any living, non-elf creature hit by a ghoul's attack must succeed at a DC 22 Fortitude save save or become Paralyzed. It can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 on each such save."
